      <p><p>Hussain..Hussain<br />
Hussayn, Hussayn, Hussayn, Hussayn..(2)</p>

<p>Ana Mazloom Hussain..(8)<br />
Mai hu mazloom Hussain</p>

<p>1. Ae azadaro madine ka safar maine kiya<br />
qabr e zahra se hata nana ka marqad chhoda<br />
dar ba dar phirta hua karbobala mein pohcha<br />
reh gayi ghar mein akeli meri beti sughra<br />
Ana Mazloom Hussain..(6)<br />
Mai hu mazloom Hussain</p>

<p>2. Maine akbar ko lahu hote hue dekha hai<br />
tukde tukde ye bhatije ka mere laasha hai<br />
mere hatho&#39;n pe hi besheer mera tadpa hai<br />
mere zaanu pe hi abbas ne dam toda hai<br />
Ana Mazloom Hussain..(6)<br />
Mai hu mazloom Hussain</p>

<p>3. Khaak aur khoon mein doobi meri tanhai hai<br />
mai bhi pyaasa hu sakina bhi meri pyaasi hai<br />
dekh kar meri musibat meri maa roti hai<br />
maine akbar ke kaleje se sina khechi hai<br />
Ana Mazloom Hussain..(6)<br />
Mai hu mazloom Hussain</p>

<p>4. Zibha ke baad bhi kam mujhpe musibat na hui<br />
ek anguthi ke liye kaat li ungli meri<br />
laash meri sume aspaas baha rondi gayi<br />
mere tukde se sadaa aati hai bus ya mahdi<br />
Ana Mazloom Hussain..(6)<br />
Mai hu mazloom Hussain</p>

<p>5. Shaam o kufa mein har ek zulm ki shiddat dekhi<br />
noke naiza se har ek bachhe ki haalat dekhi<br />
maine sajjad ke chehre ki aziyat dekhi<br />
band aankho&#39;n se bhi zainab ki musibat dekhi<br />
Ana Mazloom Hussain..(6)<br />
Mai hu mazloom Hussain</p>

<p>6. Maine lut te hue karbal mein bhara ghar dekha<br />
