noke naiza se mere sar ne ye manzar dekha<br />
majma e aam mein zainab ko khule sar dekha<br />
Ana Mazloom Hussain..(6)<br />
Mai hu mazloom Hussain</p>

<p>7. Aaj bhi dukh mere qatil mujhe dete hai mazeed<br />
gardane kaat ti hai aaj bhi wo nasle yazeed<br />
masjido&#39;n mein bhi azaa walo pe hai zulm e shadeed<br />
aaj bhi hote hai ye mere azadaar shaheed<br />
Ana Mazloom Hussain..(6)<br />
Mai hu mazloom Hussain</p>

<p>8. Mujhko maloom hai jo zulm mere baad hue<br />
maine dekha hai jalae gaye mere khaime<br />
kaise khaichi gayi zainab ki rida naize se<br />
shimr ne kaise sakina ko tamache maare<br />
Ana Mazloom Hussain..(6)<br />
Mai hu mazloom Hussain</p>

<p>9. Ae qamar kehte hai maula mai bohot tanha hu<br />
zakhm apno se jo lagte hai mujhe sehta hu<br />
door maqsad se azadaar hai mai rota hu<br />
ab bhi mazloom hu mai aaj bhi mai pyaasa hu<br />
Ana Mazloom Hussain..(6)<br />
Mai hu mazloom Hussain</p>
